{"4657650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DAIMIENS TOWN OF WITCHES", "steam_appid": 4657650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OPEN THE BOOK. AWAKEN AS A WITCH.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2026, a young woman discovers a mysterious magical book. When she reads it, she is transported back to 1764. Lost in an age ruled by fear and superstition, she discovers powers she never imagined she possessed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your witch’s name, master her magic and search for a way back to your own time. Help women accused of witchcraft and uncover the plans of the Inkisiens, a dangerous order that uses ancient grimoires to steal magic and transform its victims into monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/9e1f1f9b4bba6c4089e6ce2cd400eaf5.poster.avif?t=1786719916\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/9e1f1f9b4bba6c4089e6ce2cd400eaf5.webm?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/9e1f1f9b4bba6c4089e6ce2cd400eaf5.mp4?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT WITH SWORD, MAGIC AND BROOM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daimiens: Town of Witches is a dark fantasy Action RPG featuring real-time combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack with your sword, cast spells, dodge enemies and use a magical broom for both travel and combat. Face corrupted creatures, supernatural beings and enemies who have gained powers that should never have been theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/47d21570c72c25a07d59529445a99270.poster.avif?t=1786719916\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/47d21570c72c25a07d59529445a99270.webm?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/47d21570c72c25a07d59529445a99270.mp4?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMPLETE RITUALS AND AWAKEN MYSTICAL POWERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in magical rituals where you must react with precision and complete sequences of symbols. Every successful ritual may bring you closer to new abilities, secrets and supernatural companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/949ea608d526510d75f7b62ba63bd445.poster.avif?t=1786719916\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/949ea608d526510d75f7b62ba63bd445.webm?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/949ea608d526510d75f7b62ba63bd445.mp4?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER ALCHEMY FILLED WITH DANGER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 50 recipes for potions, transformations and magical powers. Gather ingredients by exploring, opening chests, searching shelves, buying from merchants or defeating monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may be several ways to place the ingredients into the cauldron, but only one order will be correct. If you make a mistake, you will lose the materials and may suffer unexpected consequences: poisoning, loss of gold, altered controls, monsters appearing or even death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/a14295bc5a5990e5c86f21f515035727.poster.avif?t=1786719916\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/a14295bc5a5990e5c86f21f515035727.webm?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/a14295bc5a5990e5c86f21f515035727.mp4?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHANGE YOUR FORM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use potions and magical objects to transform the protagonist’s body and unlock new possibilities. Take on supernatural forms, break spells with special relics and experience the story through different characters and creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/78d515ca1883fd6a840cfbe293a13fa3.poster.avif?t=1786719916\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/78d515ca1883fd6a840cfbe293a13fa3.webm?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/78d515ca1883fd6a840cfbe293a13fa3.mp4?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE THE STORY THROUGH DIFFERENT CHARACTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the adventure, you will control different characters, creatures and groups. Become a spider witch, live as a pirate, sail aboard a pirate ship and discover the story alongside other witches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The video shows only a few examples. You will also experience stories featuring vampires, werewolves and many other supernatural beings. Fly on a broomstick, meet extraordinary characters and speak with powerful dragons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/82a242e279b0508868bf9973b029de37.poster.avif?t=1786719916\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/82a242e279b0508868bf9973b029de37.webm?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/82a242e279b0508868bf9973b029de37.mp4?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ADVENTURE CONTINUES AFTER THE CAMPAIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing the main story, additional content is unlocked. Fly freely on your broomstick, visit different destinations and search for 50 magical books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each book requires three ingredients and hides a new power waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/6c32fcd4b2a3d8b89f489c046b498cfa.poster.avif?t=1786719916\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/6c32fcd4b2a3d8b89f489c046b498cfa.webm?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/6c32fcd4b2a3d8b89f489c046b498cfa.mp4?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE SECRETS OF DAIMIENS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consult the Witch’s Journal, collect relics and ingredients, open card packs and complete your collectible card album. Explore special locations, uncover hidden secrets and visit the unsettling shop of the mysterious Merchant Donoso.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/e4ddee1da5919a05b023341019736ae9.poster.avif?t=1786719916\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/e4ddee1da5919a05b023341019736ae9.webm?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/e4ddee1da5919a05b023341019736ae9.mp4?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INSPIRED BY THE LEGENDS OF DAIMIEL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daimiens: Town of Witches is a dark fantasy work freely inspired by the folklore, legends and certain historical elements of Daimiel, a real town in Ciudad Real, Spain, traditionally known as “the town of witches.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daimiens, its characters, organizations and events belong to a fictional universe created for the video game. The game is not intended to accurately reproduce the history of Daimiel, nor to represent, judge or offend its inhabitants, institutions or beliefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project was born as a personal tribute to the legends, culture and places of its creator’s homeland.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OPEN THE BOOK. AWAKEN AS A WITCH.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2026, a young woman discovers a mysterious magical book. When she reads it, she is transported back to 1764. Lost in an age ruled by fear and superstition, she discovers powers she never imagined she possessed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your witch’s name, master her magic and search for a way back to your own time. Help women accused of witchcraft and uncover the plans of the Inkisiens, a dangerous order that uses ancient grimoires to steal magic and transform its victims into monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/9e1f1f9b4bba6c4089e6ce2cd400eaf5.poster.avif?t=1786719916\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/9e1f1f9b4bba6c4089e6ce2cd400eaf5.webm?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/9e1f1f9b4bba6c4089e6ce2cd400eaf5.mp4?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT WITH SWORD, MAGIC AND BROOM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daimiens: Town of Witches is a dark fantasy Action RPG featuring real-time combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack with your sword, cast spells, dodge enemies and use a magical broom for both travel and combat. Face corrupted creatures, supernatural beings and enemies who have gained powers that 