erchants or defeating monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may be several ways to place the ingredients into the cauldron, but only one order will be correct. If you make a mistake, you will lose the materials and may suffer unexpected consequences: poisoning, loss of gold, altered controls, monsters appearing or even death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/a14295bc5a5990e5c86f21f515035727.poster.avif?t=1786719916\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/a14295bc5a5990e5c86f21f515035727.webm?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/a14295bc5a5990e5c86f21f515035727.mp4?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHANGE YOUR FORM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use potions and magical objects to transform the protagonist’s body and unlock new possibilities. Take on supernatural forms, break spells with special relics and experience the story through different characters and creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/78d515ca1883fd6a840cfbe293a13fa3.poster.avif?t=1786719916\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/78d515ca1883fd6a840cfbe293a13fa3.webm?t=1786719916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657650/extras/78d515ca1883fd6a840cfbe293a13fa3.mp4?t